sequenceDiagram
    participant E as Extension
    participant D as DatasetResolverImpl
    participant C as ContractDefinitionResolverImpl
    participant DB as Database

    Note over E,DB: Start-up

    E->>DB: create functions, columns & indexes (SQL script)

    Note over E,DB: On request

    Note over D: Entry: query(...)
    D->>C: resolveFor(participantContext, agent)
    activate C
    C->>C: Build participant-scoped contract-definition query and policy cache
    C->>DB: findAll(query) [ContractDefinitionStore]
    DB-->>C: Contract definitions

    loop For each contract definition
        opt Access policy not already cached
            C->>DB: findById(contextId, accessPolicyId) [PolicyDefinitionStore]
            DB-->>C: Policy definition or null
            C->>C: Cache policy if found
        end
        C->>C: Evaluate access policy for agent
        C->>C: Keep definition only if access evaluation succeeds
    end

    C-->>D: Resolved contract definitions
    deactivate C

    alt No contract definitions
        D->>D: Return empty stream
    else Contract definitions found
        D->>DB: open connection
        D->>DB: Create temp table for authorized contract definitions
        D->>DB: Copy authorized contract definitions (incl. stored split selectors) to temp table
        D->>D: Build asset query (filters, limit & offset from original query, ordered by asset ID)
        D->>DB: query assets matching query & with at least 1 match in temp table (function edc_find_matching_assets_page)
        DB-->>D: Matching assets incl. IDs of all matching, authorized contract definitions

        loop For each asset
            D->>D: Resolve distributions for protocol
            loop For each matching contract definition ID
                D->>D: Get contract definition from cache returned by ContractDefinitionResolverImpl
                opt Contract policy not already cached
                    D->>DB: findById(contextId, contractPolicyId) [PolicyDefinitionStore]
                    DB-->>D: Policy definition or null
                    D->>D: Cache policy if found
                end
                D->>D: Create OFFER policy and add offer if policy exists
            end
        end

        D->>DB: Close connection => drop temp table
    end